---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="AMECO Visitor Management System"
  description="A role-based visitor management system developed during Yosef Getnet's internship at Amhara Media Corporation."
>
  <div class="shell page">
    <div class="kicker">// PROJECT 02 · AMECO INTERNSHIP · 2025</div>
    <h1>AMECO Visitor Management System.</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
      A full-stack visitor management application developed during my Full-Stack Developer Internship at Amhara Media Corporation (AMECO), Bahir Dar.
    </p>

    <div class="button-row" style="margin: 18px 0 28px">
      <a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/Ezra2121-et/AMECO-Visitor-System-Full-MERN-app" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        View source on GitHub ↗
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="article">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>My role</h2>
        <p>
          I led a 9-member team during the internship, coordinating the work needed to build a visitor-management system and connecting the frontend workflows with the backend services.
        </p>

        <h2>What the application supports</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Separate role-based areas for administrators, receptionists and system administrators.</li>
          <li>Visitor record creation and management workflows.</li>
          <li>Protected routes and role checks for application access.</li>
          <li>Reporting and visitor analytics for administrative review.</li>
          <li>System-administration workflows for user management, application settings and logs.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Technology</h2>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">React</span>
          <span class="tag">Vite</span>
          <span class="tag">Node.js</span>
          <span class="tag">Express</span>
          <span class="tag">MongoDB</span>
          <span class="tag">Mongoose</span>
          <span class="tag">JWT</span>
        </div>

        <h2>Project evidence</h2>
        <p>
          The public repository contains the frontend pages, Express routes and controllers, Mongoose models, authentication middleware, dashboards, reporting views and system-administration screens. The repository README still needs a project-specific setup guide, so use the source code as the main technical reference for now.
        </p>

        <p style="margin-top: 28px">
          <a class="arrow mono" href="https://github.com/Ezra2121-et/AMECO-Visitor-System-Full-MERN-app" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Inspect the project repository ↗</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
